{
  "_doc": [
    "Photo-realistic assets (all CC0, from Poly Haven: https://polyhaven.com). scripts/fetch_assets.py downloads them",
    "into assets/polyhaven/ (not in git). Builders use them when present and fall back to procedural materials and",
    "meshes when not, so every build also works offline.",
    "textures: slot -> Poly Haven texture ids. The first id is the default; the others are variants that the egocentric",
    "  generator samples per episode. Textures are box-projected at their real-world size.",
    "hdris: sky = clear/partly cloudy daylight skies used for the world and the windows; overcast = flat light variants.",
    "models: slot -> Poly Haven model ids. A model is scaled to fit inside its JSON box (physics never changes).",
    "  fit 'contain' keeps proportions; 'stretch' fills the box (vegetation). 'variant' picks one root object when a",
    "  file holds several (e.g. a row of shrubs)."
  ],
  "resolution": "2k",
  "textures": {
    "floor_wood": ["laminate_floor_02", "wood_floor", "plank_flooring_02"],
